  "_comment": "The names the arcade shows. Keyed by '<system folder>/<file name>'. Nothing on disk is ever renamed: cue, gdi and track files, saves, save states and per-game settings all depend on the exact file names. 'title' is shown on the card, 'info' is the small grey line (region, revision, translation, mod), 'sort' (optional) places a game in release order when the alphabet would not. Rules: 'The' / 'A' and owner names (Disney's, Michael Jackson's) go after the main name with a comma; a real subtitle follows a colon; ' - Mod' marks a mod, listed right after the original; discs are '(Disc 1)'. Games not listed here get a cleaned-up file name automatically.",

